        ],
        "id": "S2",
        "text": "For a full-season download the message reads \"<series> - Season <n> [<quality>]\"."
      },
      {
        "cites": [
          "Sonarr.Core|M:NzbDrone.Core.Notifications.NotificationService.GetMessage(NzbDrone.Core.Tv.Series,System.Collections.Generic.List{NzbDrone.Core.Tv.Episode},NzbDrone.Core.Qualities.QualityModel)"
        ],
        "id": "S3",
        "text": "For daily series the message reads \"<series> - <air date> - <episode title> [<quality>]\", using the first episode."
      },
      {
        "cites": [
          "Sonarr.Core|M:NzbDrone.Core.Notifications.NotificationService.GetMessage(NzbDrone.Core.Tv.Series,System.Collections.Generic.List{NzbDrone.Core.Tv.Episode},NzbDrone.Core.Qualities.QualityModel)"
        ],
        "id": "S4",
        "text": "For other series the message reads \"<series> - <season>x<nn>... - <titles joined with ' + '> [<quality>]\". With no episodes it is \"<series> - [<quality>]\"."
      },
      {
        "cites": [
          "Sonarr.Core|M:NzbDrone.Core.Notifications.NotificationService.GetQualityString(NzbDrone.Core.Tv.Series,NzbDrone.Core.Qualities.QualityModel)"
        ],
        "id": "S5",
        "text": "The quality text is the quality name, followed by \" v<version>\" for anime or \" Proper\" for other series when the revision version is above 1."
      },
      {
        "cites": [
          "Sonarr.Core|M:NzbDrone.Core.Notifications.NotificationService.Handle(NzbDrone.Core.Download.DownloadCompletedEvent)",
